  "scene": "He counts down three, two, one with his fingers, launching himself. A big number at the top changes 3, 2, 1 on each spoken number, with a ring that shrinks like time running out, and the word launch flashes at the end.",
  "idea": "ตัวเลขใหญ่กลางกรอบเปลี่ยนจาก \"3\" เป็น \"2\" เป็น \"1\" ตัวละประมาณ 0.8 วินาทีตามเสียง \"สาม\" \"สอง\" \"หนึ่ง\" ทุกครั้งที่เปลี่ยน ตัวเลขจะกระแทกเข้ามาแล้วย่อลง และมีวงแหวนรอบตัวเลขที่ค่อย ๆ หดหายเหมือนเวลาที่เหลือ ตอนจบมีคำว่า \"ปล่อยตัว!\" วาบขึ้นแวบหนึ่ง",
  "html": "<style>\n.st{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:996px;height:290px;overflow:hidden;animation:out .15s 2.52s forwards}\n.st svg{position:absolute;left:0;top:0}\n.num{position:absolute;left:348px;top:0;width:300px;height:290px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:280px;line-height:1;color:var(--ink);opacity:0}\n.n3{animation:slam .8s calc(var(--w1) * 1s - .1s) both,gone .1s calc(var(--w2) * 1s - .1s) forwards}\n.n2{animation:slam .8s calc(var(--w2) * 1s - .15s) both,gone .1s calc(var(--w3) * 1s - .1s) forwards}\n.n1{animation:slam .8s calc(var(--w3) * 1s - .15s) both,gone .08s calc(var(--w3) * 1s + .1s) forwards}\n.disc{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;animation:thump .3s calc(var(--w2) * 1s - .15s) both}\n.disc2{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;animation:thump .3s calc(var(--w3) * 1s - .15s) both}\n.fl{position:absolute;left:278px;top:85px;width:440px;height:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bar);color:var(--text);font-size:80px;border:6px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;box-sizing:border-box;opacity:0;animation:flash .3s calc(var(--w3) * 1s + .08s) both}\n@keyframes slam{0%{transform:scale(1.35);opacity:0}20%{transform:scale(.9);opacity:1}32%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}100%{transform:scale(.94);opacity:1}}\n@keyframes gone{to{opacity:0;transform:scale(.6)}}\n@keyframes thump{0%{transform:scale(1)}40%{transform:scale(1.06)}100%{transform:scale(1)}}\n@keyframes flash{0%{transform:scale(.4) rotate(-6deg);opacity:0}55%{transform:scale(1.1) rotate(2deg);opacity:1}100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(-2deg);opacity:1}}\n@keyframes out{to{opacity:0}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"st\">\n<svg width=\"996\" height=\"290\" viewBox=\"0 0 996 290\">\n<g class=\"disc\"><g class=\"disc2\">\n<circle cx=\"498\" cy=\"145\" r=\"114\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n</g></g>\n<circle cx=\"498\" cy=\"145\" r=\"126\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"18\"/>\n<circle id=\"ring\" cx=\"498\" cy=\"145\" r=\"126\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"791.7\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" transform=\"rotate(-90 498 145)\"/>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"num n3\">3</div>\n<div class=\"num n2\">2</div>\n<div class=\"num n1\">1</div>\n<div class=\"fl\">ปล่อยตัว!</div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst ring = document.getElementById(\"ring\");\nconst C = 791.7;\nwindow.frame = (t) => {\n  const starts = [T[0], T[1], T[2]];\n  const ends = [T[1], T[2], T[2] + 0.3];\n  let i = 0;\n  if (t >= starts[2]) i = 2; else if (t >= starts[1]) i = 1;\n  let p = (t - starts[i]) / Math.max(0.05, ends[i] - starts[i]);\n  p = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, p));\n  ring.setAttribute(\"stroke-dashoffset\", String(C * p));\n  ring.style.opacity = p >= 1 ? \"0\" : \"1\";\n};\nwindow.frame(0);\n</script>",
