  "scene": "The punchline: he smiles, now we are in space. Stars twinkle in, a small rocket curves into orbit round a planet, and a label saying we reached space pops up; right after this he says wow, amazing.",
  "idea": "ดาวจุดเล็ก ๆ ค่อย ๆ กะพริบขึ้นเต็มกรอบ แล้วจรวดเล็กโค้งเข้าวงโคจรรอบดาวเคราะห์วงกลมทางขวา ข้อความ \"ถึงอวกาศแล้ว!\" เด้งขึ้นพอดีคำว่า \"อวกาศกันแล้ว\"",
  "html": "<style>\n.st{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:996px;height:290px;overflow:hidden;animation:out .35s 1.35s both}\n.st svg{position:absolute;left:0;top:0}\n.pl{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;animation:grow .5s calc(var(--w2) * 1s - .1s) both cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1)}\n.plate{position:absolute;left:50px;top:92px;padding:12px 34px 18px;background:var(--bar);border:5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:26px;transform-origin:30% 60%;animation:pop .45s calc(var(--w6) * 1s - .3s) both cubic-bezier(.3,1.7,.5,1)}\n.tx{color:var(--text);font-size:64px;line-height:1.15;white-space:nowrap}\n.dot{position:absolute;left:-18px;top:-18px;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);border:4px solid var(--ink);animation:pop .4s calc(var(--w7) * 1s - .2s) both cubic-bezier(.3,1.7,.5,1)}\n@keyframes grow{from{transform:scale(0)}to{transform:scale(1)}}\n@keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(0) rotate(-8deg);opacity:0}60%{opacity:1}100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(0);opacity:1}}\n@keyframes out{from{opacity:1}to{opacity:0}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"st\">\n<svg width=\"996\" height=\"290\" viewBox=\"0 0 996 290\">\n<g id=\"stars\"></g>\n<path id=\"orb\" d=\"M 530 272 C 640 262, 760 200, 850 195 A 115 50 0 1 0 849 195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(850 145)\"><g class=\"pl\">\n<circle r=\"62\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"-20\" cy=\"-18\" r=\"13\" fill=\"color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 60%, var(--ink))\"/>\n<circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"20\" r=\"9\" fill=\"color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 60%, var(--ink))\"/>\n<path d=\"M -95 12 Q 0 45 95 -12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M -95 12 Q 0 45 95 -12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--alt)\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</g></g>\n<g id=\"rk\" opacity=\"0\">\n<path d=\"M -26 0 L -40 -6 L -36 0 L -40 6 Z\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M -14 -8 L -26 -18 L -22 -4 Z M -14 8 L -26 18 L -22 4 Z\" fill=\"var(--alt)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M -24 -9 L 6 -9 Q 24 0 6 9 L -24 9 Z\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"var(--alt)\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"plate\"><div class=\"dot\"></div><span class=\"tx\">ถึงอวกาศแล้ว!</span></div>\n</div>\n<script>\nconst NS = \"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\";\nconst sg = document.getElementById(\"stars\");\nfor (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {\n  const x = 20 + ((i * 0.618034 * 996) % 956);\n  const y = 16 + ((i * 0.41421 * 290 + i * 37) % 258);\n  const r = 2.5 + (i % 3) * 1.5;\n  const c = document.createElementNS(NS, \"circle\");\n  c.setAttribute(\"cx\", x.toFixed(1));\n  c.setAttribute(\"cy\", y.toFixed(1));\n  c.setAttribute(\"r\", r);\n  c.setAttribute(\"fill\", i % 5 === 0 ? \"var(--alt)\" : \"var(--paper)\");\n  c.setAttribute(\"stroke\", \"var(--ink)\");\n  c.setAttribute(\"stroke-width\", \"2\");\n  sg.appendChild(c);\n  c.animate([{opacity:0},{opacity:1,offset:0.4},{opacity:0.35,offset:0.7},{opacity:1}],\n    {duration: 1000, delay: (i * 97) % 600, fill: \"both\", easing: \"ease-out\"});\n}\nconst orb = document.getElementById(\"orb\");\nconst rk = document.getElementById(\"rk\");\nconst L = orb.getTotalLength();\nconst t0 = T[2] - 0.05;\nconst t1 = T[8] + 0.05;\nwindow.frame = (t) => {\n  let p = (t - t0) / (t1 - t0);\n  if (p <= 0) { rk.setAttribute(\"opacity\", \"0\"); return; }\n  p = Math.min(p, 1);\n  const e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 2);\n  const d = e * (L - 2);\n  const a = orb.getPointAtLength(d);\n  const b = orb.getPointAtLength(Math.min(d + 2, L));\n  const ang = Math.atan2(b.y - a.y, b.x - a.x) * 180 / Math.PI;\n  rk.setAttribute(\"opacity\", Math.min(1, p * 6).toFixed(2));\n  rk.setAttribute(\"transform\", \"translate(\" + a.x.toFixed(1) + \" \" + a.y.toFixed(1) + \") rotate(\" + ang.toFixed(1) + \")\");\n};\n</script>",
